msgstr ""

#: app/views/about.scm:306 app/views/about.scm:316
msgid ""
"byggsteg is free software under the MIT License. Take it, run it on your "
"own machine, read it, break it, and add the step it is missing: that is "
"the door this page is about."
msgstr ""

